# The picture of export-import.md: the export settings of the
# preferences screen. The Triangle Mesh dialog and the file choosers are
# not drawn on the headless platform, so the page gives them in words.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
menu Edit|Preferences...
# Scrolled down to the export settings.
twscroll 300 300 -3.4
mark 8 32 345 82 tw
mark 8 272 390 326 tw
shot export-import-1-preferences tw
